  "status": "verified-sample",
  "coverage": "complete",
  "notes": [
    "Plain JavaScript module for the CQ-12T, CQ-18T and CQ-20B (manifest). The 9 actions in actions.js getActionDefinitions and the 2 feedbacks in feedbacks.js are all catalogued; they are returned from one object literal each.",
    "The channel, target and value dropdowns use the label of the strip as id (for example Ip1, St1, MainLR, DCA1, Out1; helpers.js: muteParameters line 1, panMatrix 43, levelMatrixInputs 214, levelMatrixOutputs 553, dbValues 571, panValues 634). The lists are closed: the module looks the id up in these tables and does nothing for unknown ids.",
    "The mute action option \"command\" has a tooltip in the source that Toggle does not work for mute groups and DCAs (actions.js:18-30).",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.11.0 (1.x): option values do not support expressions.",
    "Not catalogued: config fields, variables and presets."
  ],
